Package: ISPPCropLossDB
Title: Collaborative Crop Loss Database (Prototype Shiny Application)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Paul", "Melloy", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "paul.melloy@csiro.au",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4253-7167"))
Description: Prototype web application for the International Society for
    Plant Pathology Crop Loss Subcommittee database. Researchers sign in
    with ORCID, submit and edit crop loss observations, and every change
    is recorded in a PostgreSQL audit trail.
